    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This is companion plugin is created for Envo themes.<br />\nThe plugin add custom frontpage sections for Envo themes and it will allow you full customizer settings for the theme front page sections.<br />\nThe plugin options are user-friendly and you can use this plugin for all envo child themes also.</p>\n<p>Have any queries?</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<p>Version 0.0.7<br />\n* Webenvo section title tag changed from h1 to h2<br />\n* Author updated</p>\n<p>Version 0.0.6<br />\n* Webenvo Pro screenshot &amp; link added.</p>\n<p>Version 0.0.5<br />\n* Webenvo theme data added.</p>\n<p>Version 0.0.4<br />\n* Theme name envo change to webenvo.</p>\n<p>Version 0.0.2<br />\n* Demo data added for theme Envo.</p>\n<p>Start with version 0.0.1<br />\nThis is an initial release.</p>\n"
    },
